  _LancesRoomLanceAfterBattleText = "I still can't\nbelieve my\vdragons lost to\vyou, {PLAYER}!\fYou are now the\nPOKéMON LEAGUE\vchampion!\f...Or, you would\nhave been, but\vyou have one more\vchallenge ahead.\fYou have to face\nanother trainer!\vHis name is...\f{RIVAL}!\nHe beat the ELITE\vFOUR before you!\fHe is the real\nPOKéMON LEAGUE\vchampion!",
